# Development Prospects of Smart Contracts in the Context of DeFi Platforms Devel-opment and their Impact on Optimization of Business Processes in Russian Banking Sector until 2027

**Authors:** N.S. Semushkin, M.A. Semushkina

## Abstract
Smart contracts are a new form of registering obligations between parties that have emerged together with the digital age. Realizing the necessity of stronger digital leadership in the global market, Russian lawmakers are actively working on legal framework for using these structures. Businesses, in turn, are testing new technical solutions to reduce costs and optimize internal processes. The article is the result of the experience analysis of smart con-tracts on the DeFi platform. It gives forecasts of development direction in the coming years.

